1
00:00:07,063 --> 00:00:09,107
Seung-hyun!

2
00:00:12,303 --> 00:00:14,764
Thought you were
heading home.

3
00:00:14,764 --> 00:00:16,725
Ji-sung?

4
00:00:16,725 --> 00:00:18,727
What are you doing here?

5
00:00:18,727 --> 00:00:21,229
Felt like today

6
00:00:21,229 --> 00:00:23,815
called for this.

7
00:00:23,815 --> 00:00:26,276
What do you mean by today?

8
00:00:26,276 --> 00:00:30,947
Just found myself
thinking of you.

9
00:00:38,737 --> 00:00:41,740
You made this yourself?

10
00:00:44,544 --> 00:00:47,255
My sister

11
00:00:47,255 --> 00:00:50,216
runs a lunchbox shop.

12
00:00:50,216 --> 00:00:53,219
I learned from her.

13
00:00:53,219 --> 00:00:56,222
Oh, your sister...

14
00:01:00,435 --> 00:01:03,396
She seemed pretty.

15
00:01:12,864 --> 00:01:14,240
You're prettier.
